{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Raptors vs. Goblins",
    "steam_appid": 3665550,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665550/extras/ee2acbd429be3b6ad64d408ea0c59496.avif?t=1745346790\" width=462 height=174 /></span><br><br><strong>- WELCOME TO RAPTORS VS. GOBLINS -</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build your own army and fight against the onslaught of enemy goblins on the battlefield. Play through the story mode and level up your arsenal and unlock new weapons, troops, and challenges. For quick and easy fun, play through the challenges tab, where all activities are free to the player without unlocks.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You Are in Control!</strong>Not only do your towers fight for you, but you are too! Join your roster of raptors and keep an eye on that clip. You're packing heat, and the goblins are only getting stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eye on the prize!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn money for each run you win (or lose). Use bones to purchase new equipment/perks for you and your army.<br><br><strong>Fight the Good Fight!</strong><br>Build up your character to be the best fighting machine possible. Swap out your cards in your deck from troops you unlock along the way, give your character a shiny new gun with an entirely new play style (I'm looking at you, recycler), choose bonus perks to help aid you in the fight, and rebuild the kingdom to its former glory to help boost your army.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete Customization</strong><br>Not feeling the basic look of your raptor? Or even the map you're on? All that is just a button press away. Unlock new hats, face-items, guns, raptor colours, and even change the map you play on in free play modes. The world is your oyster, not literally though.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665550/extras/ee2acbd429be3b6ad64d408ea0c59496.avif?t=1745346790\" width=462 height=174 /></span><br><br><strong>- WELCOME TO RAPTORS VS. GOBLINS -</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build your own army and fight against the onslaught of enemy goblins on the battlefield. Play through the story mode and level up your arsenal and unlock new weapons, troops, and challenges. For quick and easy fun, play through the challenges tab, where all activities are free to the player without unlocks.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You Are in Control!</strong>Not only do your towers fight for you, but you are too! Join your roster of raptors and keep an eye on that clip. You're packing heat, and the goblins are only getting stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eye on the prize!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn money for each run you win (or lose). Use bones to purchase new equipment/perks for you and your army.<br><br><strong>Fight the Good Fight!</strong><br>Build up your character to be the best fighting machine possible. Swap out your cards in your deck from troops you unlock along the way, give your character a shiny new gun with an entirely new play style (I'm looking at you, recycler), choose bonus perks to help aid you in the fight, and rebuild the kingdom to its former glory to help boost your army.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete Customization</strong><br>Not feeling the basic look of your raptor? Or even the map you're on? All that is just a button press away. Unlock new hats, face-items, guns, raptor colours, and even change the map you play on in free play modes. The world is your oyster, not literally though.</p>",
    "short_description": "When two unorthodox worlds collide, you get RAPTORS VS. GOBLINS. Fight of hordes of goblins and defend your kingdom! Reclaim what's yours and keep fighting to get stronger. Throw the Goblin King out of the ranks and save the Island in this top-down tower defense!",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
